Return to the loop when it matters — Background work does not remove you from important decisions. When a task needs clarification, approval, or engineering judgment, NexPath brings you back into the loop. You remain the decision-maker. The aim is to save waiting time and reduce repetitive coordination while keeping you involved where your judgment makes a difference.
